sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant L as Login / Signup page
    participant SA as Supabase Auth
    participant T as Trigger handle_new_user
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant AP as AuthProvider
    participant G as Route Guard

    U->>L: enter creds OR click Google
    L->>SA: signInWithPassword / signUp / signInWithOAuth
    SA-->>L: session + JWT
    Note over SA,T: on signup only
    SA->>T: AFTER INSERT on auth.users
    T->>DB: INSERT profiles (id, full_name, ...)
    T->>DB: INSERT user_roles (user_id, 'user')
    SA-->>AP: onAuthStateChange(SIGNED_IN, session)
    AP->>DB: SELECT role FROM user_roles WHERE user_id = $1
    DB-->>AP: roles[]
    AP->>AP: setUser, setRoles, monitoring.identify
    U->>G: navigate to /dashboard or /admin
    G->>AP: useAuth() user, roles, isAdmin
    alt user missing
        G-->>U: redirect /login
    else not admin and AdminRoute
        G-->>U: redirect / and toast
    else allowed
        G-->>U: render page
    end
